Content-Type:   text/plain; charset=US-ASCII
X-Originating-IP: [10.175.127.227]
X-ClientProxiedBy: dggems706-chm.china.huawei.com (10.3.19.183) To
 canpemm500005.china.huawei.com (7.192.104.229)
